%% aoneahsan-cccs-search-audit — /search-audit flow (2026-10-27)
flowchart TD
    start([/search-audit in ONE production root]) --> guard{Frozen, protected<br/>or client?}
    guard -->|yes| stop([STOP and say so.<br/>Its records stay in the<br/>non-production register])
    guard -->|no| understand[Read CLAUDE.md, the registry row,<br/>the baseline records for this root]
    understand --> resume{Unfinished run<br/>RESUME.md?}
    resume -->|yes| continue[Resume it — never re-plan]
    resume -->|no| manifest[Manifest: every surface + repo<br/>web · docs · npm · extension · Android · API]
    continue --> fixwaves
    manifest --> calibrate[Calibrate probes on a known-bad URL<br/>— a probe never seen failing is not a gate]
    calibrate --> lane[search-auditor lane, read-only:<br/>SA-P01…P19 + AI-01…09 on every surface,<br/>live first, then source file:line]
    lane --> repro[Main session reproduces each FAIL<br/>in the BUILT output]
    repro --> ask{Owner-only or<br/>outcome-changing?}
    ask -->|yes| batch[ONE question batch,<br/>answers recorded]
    ask -->|no| fixwaves
    batch --> fixwaves
    fixwaves[Fix waves: wrong host + canonical →<br/>discovery endpoints → sitemap + real 404 →<br/>preview assets → AEO content.<br/>Gates after each wave]
    fixwaves --> ship[Commit · push · deploy per grants<br/>render 1440/390 · bundle hash live]
    ship --> live[Re-run the probes LIVE<br/>then IndexNow the changed URLs]
    live --> record[Report + STATUS.json in<br/>reports-for-dot-agent/projects/&lt;project&gt;/<br/>MANUAL-TASKS console rows]
    record --> learn[Learning inbox file for this run<br/>+ in-place fix of any wrong probe or skill]
    learn --> done([Report: before → after per pattern,<br/>google-pending kept honest])

    fleet([/search-audit fleet from 01-code]) --> agg[Read every STATUS.json,<br/>re-probe live, one project at a time]
    agg --> merge[search-curator merges the inbox<br/>into catalogue + skills; validate]
    merge --> confirm([FLEET-CONFIRMATION + index refresh])

    classDef warn fill:#fef2f2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    classDef gateNode fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    class guard,resume,ask gateNode
    class stop warn
    class start,done,fleet,confirm terminal
